  "staff": {
    "elements": [
      {
        "id": 7478,
        "pageBreak": true,
        "elementType": "RichTextBox",
        "content": "<p class=\"neanes-paragraph-style-default-text\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:26pt;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;\"><span style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);display:inline !important;float:none;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:center;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:break-spaces;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Ἀργὰ Ἰδιόμελα εἰς τὴν Προσκύνησιν \nτοῦ Τιμίου καὶ Ζωοποιοῦ Σταυροῦ\nὑπὸ Γερμανοῦ Νέων Πατρῶν (ιζ΄ αἰῶνος)</span></span></p><p class=\"neanes-paragraph-style-default-text\" style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"neanes-paragraph-style-default-text\" style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"neanes-paragraph-style-default-text\" style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"neanes-paragraph-style-default-text\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:20pt;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;\"><span style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);display:inline !important;float:none;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:center;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:break-spaces;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Ἐξηγηθέντα ἐκ τῆς παλαιᾶς εἰς τὴν νέαν γραφήν</span></span></p><p class=\"neanes-paragraph-style-default-text\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:20pt;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;\"><span style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);display:inline !important;float:none;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:center;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:break-spaces;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">παρὰ Χουρμουζίου Χαρτοφύλακος</span></span></p><p class=\"neanes-paragraph-style-default-text\" style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"neanes-paragraph-style-default-text\" style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"neanes-paragraph-style-default-text\" style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"neanes-paragraph-style-default-text\" style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"neanes-paragraph-style-default-text\" style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"neanes-paragraph-style-default-text\" style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"neanes-paragraph-style-default-text\" style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"neanes-paragraph-style-default-text\" style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"neanes-paragraph-style-default-text\" style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"neanes-paragraph-style-default-text\" style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"neanes-paragraph-style-default-text\" style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"neanes-paragraph-style-default-text\" style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"neanes-paragraph-style-default-text\" style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"neanes-paragraph-style-default-text\" style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"neanes-paragraph-style-default-text\" style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"neanes-paragraph-style-default-text\" style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"neanes-paragraph-style-default-text\" style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"neanes-paragraph-style-default-text\" style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"neanes-paragraph-style-default-text\" style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"neanes-paragraph-style-default-text\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:20pt;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;\"><span style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);display:inline !important;float:none;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:center;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:break-spaces;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Ἐκ τοῦ χειρογράφου 750</span></span></p><p class=\"neanes-paragraph-style-default-text\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:20pt;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;\"><span style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);display:inline !important;float:none;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:center;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:break-spaces;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Μετοχίου Παναγίου Τάφου</span></span></p><p class=\"neanes-paragraph-style-default-text\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:20pt;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;\"><span style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);display:inline !important;float:none;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:center;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:break-spaces;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Στιχηράριον Γερμανοῦ Νέων Πατρῶν Τόμος Α΄</span></span></p><p class=\"neanes-paragraph-style-default-text\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:20pt;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;\"><span style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);display:inline !important;float:none;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:center;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:break-spaces;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">ἐν Κωνσταντινούπολει</span></span></p><p class=\"neanes-paragraph-style-default-text\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:20pt;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;\"><span style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);display:inline !important;float:none;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:center;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:break-spaces;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">͵αωλβʹ. 1832.</span></span></p><p class=\"neanes-paragraph-style-default-text\" style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"neanes-paragraph-style-default-text\" style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"neanes-paragraph-style-default-text\" style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</p>",
        "contentBottom": "",
        "contentLeft": "",
        "contentRight": "",
        "contentCenter": "",
        "modeChangePhysicalNote": "Pa",
        "modeChangeScale": "Diatonic",
        "modeChangeBpm": 120,
        "height": 1045.175048828125,
        "marginTop": 0,
        "marginBottom": 0
      },
      {
        "id": 7462,
        "elementType": "RichTextBox",
        "content": "<p class=\"neanes-paragraph-style-default-text\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"color:#800000;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;\"><span style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);display:inline !important;float:none;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:center;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:break-spaces;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Α΄ Ἰδιόμελον</span></span></p><p style=\"margin-left:0px;text-align:center;\"><span style=\"color:#800000;\">Ποίημα Λέοντος Δεσπότου.</span></p><p style=\"margin-left:0px;text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"color:#800000;\">Δ</span>εῦτε πιστοί, τὸ ζωοποιὸν Ξύλον προσκυνήσωμεν· ἐν ᾧ Χριστὸς ὁ Βασιλεὺς τῆς δόξης, ἑκουσίως χεῖρας ἐκτείνας. ὕψωσεν ἡμᾶς εἰς τὴν ἀρχαίαν μακαριότητα· οὓς πρὶν ὁ ἐχθρός, δι’ ἡδονῆς συλήσας, ἐξορίστους Θεοῦ πεποίηκε. Δεῦτε πιστοὶ Ξύλον προσκυνήσωμεν, δι’ οὗ ἠξιώθημεν, τῶν ἀοράτων ἐχθρῶν συντρίβειν τὰς κάρας. Δεῦτε πᾶσαι αἱ πατριαὶ τῶν ἐθνῶν, τὸν Σταυρὸν τοῦ Κυρίου ὕμνοις τιμήσωμεν. Χαίροις Σταυρὲ τοῦ πεσόντος Ἀδὰμ ἡ τελεία λύτρωσις· ἐν σοὶ οἱ πιστότατοι Βασιλεῖς ἡμῶν καυχῶνται ὡς τῇ σῇ δυνάμει, Ἰσμαηλίτην λαόν, κραταιῶς ὑποτάσσοντες. Σὲ νῦν μετὰ φόβου, Χριστιανοὶ ἀσπαζόμεθα, καὶ τὸν ἐν σοὶ προσπαγέντα Θεόν, δοξάζομεν λέγοντες· Κύριε, ὁ ἐν αὐτῷ προσπαγείς, ἐλέησον ἡμᾶς, ὡς ἀγαθὸς καὶ φιλάνθρωπος.</p>",
